// What the three grant-carrying items are worth in a fight, against the
// same fight without them.
//
// `equip` is **top-level**, not inside `Fresh(...)` — a row in the wrong
// place is ignored silently, and identical numbers across a sweep read as
// a dead feature rather than an unread input.
//
// The companion is carrying one too, which is the case the feature adds for
// free and the one no other instrument reaches: gear is wearable by any
// owned program, so a granted passive is a companion's as readily as the
// player's.
//
// To read this, run it against a scenario with the same three slots filled
// by plain gear of the same tier — the numbers here mean nothing on their
// own, only beside that. Arena figures compare within one build only.
//
// Four rootkits and not three, since 2026-08-18. Three measured 100% wins at
// 97% Integrity remaining, which is a fight where a defensive passive has
// nothing to show because nobody was ever in danger; four is the on-curve
// band of `docs/measurements/2026-08-18-gear-passive-worth.md` — 70% wins on
// plain gear — and it is where every item on the branch reads clearest.
(
    player: Fresh(level: 12, zone: 3),
    equip: [
        (item: "interrupt_coil"),
        (item: "parity_weave"),
        (item: "watchdog_tap"),
    ],
    party: [
        (species: "scrapper", level: 12, equip: [(item: "parity_weave")]),
    ],
    opponents: [(species: "rootkit", count: 4)],
    reps: 30,
    seed: 7,
)
